      "responseRegion": {
        "id": "debate-reveal-1",
        "area": {
          "x": 70,
          "y": 272,
          "width": 776,
          "height": 296
        },
        "ariaLabel": "Reveal the argument for watching a film at home",
        "revealText": "In my opinion, watching a film at home is better than\nwatching it at the cinema. To begin with, it is much cheaper\nto stream films at home, so why go to the expense of going to\nthe cinema? Although people generally consider going to the\ncinema an entertaining social event, it is more convenient to\nwatch a film in the comfort of your own home than in a\ncrowded cinema. Furthermore, you can pause the film\nwhenever you need to, and you won’t have to put up with\nnoise from other spectators. For these reasons, I believe that\nit’s better to watch a film at home.",
