      "responseRegion": {
        "id": "debate-reveal-2",
        "area": {
          "x": 390,
          "y": 242,
          "width": 634,
          "height": 236
        },
        "ariaLabel": "Reveal the argument for going to the cinema",
        "revealText": "Many people say that watching films at home is cheaper and\nmore convenient. However, I believe that going to the cinema is\nmuch more entertaining than streaming films at home. Being\nat the cinema with others can be a wonderful experience and\nan opportunity to socialise with others. It allows us to feel\nconnected with other people, which is very important in life.\nAlthough watching a film at home is great, in my view it\ndoesn’t compare with going to the cinema.",
